  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h4 data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"235\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"235\">Brand Introduction:</strong></h4><p data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"736\">I'm Fabulous Cosmetics is a luxury, plant-based skincare brand dedicated to delivering high-performance, medical-grade formulations using clean, organic, and cruelty-free ingredients. Founded by a licensed medical esthetician, the brand merges science-backed skincare with holistic beauty, offering solutions that are both effective and gentle. It is particularly known for its innovative peels and serums, designed for those who want visible results without compromising their skin health or values.</p><h4 data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"767\"><strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"767\">Product Description:</strong></h4><p data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"851\">I'm Fabulous Cosmetics offers a wide range of skin-transforming products including:</p><ul data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"1572\"><li data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"973\"><p data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"973\"><strong data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"875\">Bio Gorgeous Peel</strong>: A gentle yet effective organic facial peel that exfoliates, brightens, and rejuvenates the skin.</p></li><li data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1118\"><p data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1118\"><strong data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"997\">TCA Gorgeous Peel</strong>: A monthly-use, professional-grade trichloroacetic acid peel to treat hyperpigmentation, acne scars, and signs of aging.</p></li><li data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1271\"><p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1271\"><strong data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1144\">Caviar Luxury Serum</strong>: A nutrient-rich, anti-aging serum infused with marine botanicals, caviar extract, and peptides for deep hydration and repair.</p></li><li data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1427\"><p data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1427\"><strong data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1299\">Collagen Repair Cream</strong>: A luxurious moisturizer that stimulates collagen production and improves skin elasticity using clean, plant-based ingredients.</p></li><li data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1572\"><p data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1572\"><strong data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1460\">Wireless Microneedling Pen</strong>: A professional-grade microneedling device that enhances serum absorption and boosts skin rejuvenation at home.</p></li></ul><h4 data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1610\"><strong data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1610\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></h4><ul data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"2222\"><li data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1728\"><p data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1728\"><strong data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1644\">Plant-Based + Medical Grade</strong>: Unique combination of organic ingredients with professional-strength formulations.</p></li><li data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1851\"><p data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1851\"><strong data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1755\">Cruelty-Free &amp; Vegan</strong>: Ethical products made without animal testing or animal-derived ingredients (where applicable).</p></li><li data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1963\"><p data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1963\"><strong data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1881\">Visible Results at Home</strong>: Professional-quality treatments that can be safely and effectively used at home.</p></li><li data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2076\"><p data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2076\"><strong data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1987\">Founder Expertise</strong>: Created by a licensed medical esthetician with decades of hands-on skincare experience.</p></li><li data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2222\"><p data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2222\"><strong data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2098\">Custom Routines</strong>: Products can be tailored to suit specific skin types and concerns, including acne, hyperpigmentation, aging, and dullness.</p></li></ul><h4 data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2247\"><strong data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2247\">Payment Terms:</strong></h4><ul data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2559\"><li data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2346\"><p data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2346\"><strong data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2268\">Online Payment</strong>: Accepts major credit cards, PayPal, and other secure online payment methods.</p></li><li data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2460\"><p data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2460\"><strong data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2371\">Buy Now, Pay Later</strong>: Offers financing options via Klarna or Afterpay (depending on availability and region).</p></li><li data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2559\"><p data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2559\"><strong data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2492\">No Subscriptions Required</strong>: One-time purchases with optional bundles or sets for added value.</p></li></ul><h4 data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2588\"><strong data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2588\">Other Information:</strong></h4><ul data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"3059\"><li data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2696\"><p data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2696\"><strong data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2603\">Shipping</strong>: Ships internationally with expedited and standard options. Eco-conscious packaging is used.</p></li><li data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2809\"><p data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2809\"><strong data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2715\">Skin Support</strong>: Offers personalized skincare consultations and detailed usage instructions for each product.</p></li><li data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2923\"><p data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2923\"><strong data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2830\">Sustainability</strong>: Committed to sustainability through recyclable packaging and ethically sourced ingredients.</p></li><li data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"3059\"><p data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"3059\"><strong data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2947\">Community-Focused</strong>: Active on social media and frequently shares educational content, customer transformations, and skincare tips.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
